@TicketSystem.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5197

### Create incident
POST {{TicketSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Database connection timeout"
}

### List incidents
GET {{TicketSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/incidents

### Resolve incident
POST {{TicketSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/incidents/{{incidentId}}/resolve
